autofusion_router/arms.json holds the one router arm this build ships. Its `trained_license` names the licence
tiers of the query collections it was trained on; `all` includes non-commercial and unlicensed
sources. `trained_lanes` lists those collections; the weights contain no text from them.
Word rarity comes from the wordfreq dependency, whose data is CC-BY-SA 4.0.

Training data acknowledgements, by the ALLOW_LICENSE level this build was exported at.
